DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n✨ **She Owns It Meetup** ✨\n\n**Apr
 il Featured Guest: Kim Von Berg\,** founder of Thriving Loving Relationshi
 ps — a relationship counselor and communication expert who helps individ
 uals and couples create deeper\, more connected\, and more fulfilling rela
 tionships.\n\nKim will tell her story — how she got here\, what shaped h
 er path\, and the patterns she’s seen that keep people stuck. Through he
 r work\, she helps people understand themselves more clearly\, communicate
  more honestly\, and create relationships that feel more aligned and real.
 \n\n✨**Each month\, She Owns It AVL gathers women ready to grow\, connec
 t\, and belong. We focus on life\, money\, mindset\, and wellness — crea
 ting space for real conversations\, meaningful relationships\, and lasting
  connection and inspiration.**\nWe can’t wait to see you there!💫\n\n*
 *Come early to connect! 5:30**\nWe’re so grateful for everyone who signs
  up to join us! If your plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it helps u
 s plan the evening and make space for other women who’d love to attend.
